    {
      "id": "19325",
      "key": "SFCC-826",
      "summary": "Cart – Duties & Taxes Text Display",
      "description": "As a\n Shopper, \n\n\nI want\n to see a message in the cart telling me whether duties and taxes are included in the displayed price or may be payable on delivery, \nso that \nI understand my total cost before proceeding to checkout.\nThis story covers the cart (bag) text display only. PDP messaging is covered in \nhttps://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-468\n. Checkout-level messaging is handled by Global-e and is out of scope. The cart component itself is \nhttps://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-816\n.\nThe cart reads the active Global-e session country and checks it against a configured DDP and DDU country list to determine which message to show. The list is maintained in a single Contentful entry (UI Copy content model), not toggled per individual locale — one update covers all countries in that Terms of Trade group. Message text is also managed in Contentful. No BM configuration or code deployment required to update either the list or the text.\nThree Terms of Trade states apply across Global-e international markets:\nHidden DDP — 50 countries. \nCart text: \"Duties and taxes are included in the price displayed\"\n\n\nDuties and taxes are collected by Global-e and embedded in the displayed price. Shopper pays nothing additional on delivery. Four Hidden DDP variants exist; all show the same cart text:\nStandard Hidden DDP (42 countries): United Arab Emirates, Saudi Arabia, Mexico, Switzerland, Norway, Singapore, Liechtenstein, Hong Kong SAR China, Qatar, Malaysia, Martinique, Nigeria, Saint Barthélemy, Japan, Angola, Guadeloupe, Israel, Tanzania, Benin, Kenya, Reunion, Burkina Faso, South Korea, Taiwan, Kuwait, Bahrain, Lebanon, Oman, Thailand, China, Egypt, Macau SAR China, Jordan, Morocco, Saint Martin, Namibia, Seychelles, Sierra Leone, Senegal, Sao Tome and Principe, Togo, Uganda\nHidden DDP + 20% CE (5 countries): Canada, Cayman Islands, Bermuda, Guatemala, Colombia\nHidden DDP + 30% CE (2 countries): Peru, Panama\nHidden DDP + 60% CE (1 country): Brazil\nThe CE (customs estimate) variants include an estimated customs clearance charge embedded in the price. The cart text is the same as standard Hidden DDP — the CE amount is reflected in the checkout total, not a separate cart label.\nDDU — no cart message.\n\n\nDuties and taxes are not collected at checkout. The Shopper may be charged on delivery. The Global Market Proposition spreadsheet specifies a GE checkout-level DDU text only which is out of scope.\nDomestic — no cart message.\n\n\n32 countries (AU, UK, US, EU member states, Monaco, Puerto Rico, etc.) are served by domestic storefronts and they show no cart message. Their checkout messaging is handled by \nhttps://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-921\n.\nImage for Reference (Figma is leading)",
