      "id": "18825",
      "key": "SFCC-462",
      "summary": "US Tax Display — Exclusive Pricing & Checkout Calculation",
      "description": "As a \nSite Admin, \n\n\nI want\n to configure SFCC Business Manager to display prices excluding tax on US storefronts, \n\n\nso that\n US shoppers see pre-tax prices during browsing and the correct tax is applied at checkout.\n\n\n\n\nBoth US storefronts display prices exclusive of tax. The checkout tax handling differs per storefront:\nUS Domestic\n — SFCC owns the checkout. Avalara calculates state-level tax and displays it as a separate \"TAX\" line item in the order summary.\nUS International\n — Global-e owns the checkout. Tax and duties calculation at checkout is Global-e's responsibility and is out of scope for this story.\nCart-level tax line item display is covered in \nhttps://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-274\n .",
