    {
      "id": "17883",
      "key": "SFCC-47",
      "summary": "Global-e FX & Pricing Job",
      "description": "As a\n Site Admin, \n\n\nI want\n SFCC to run a nightly job that retrieves locked FX rates and rounding rules from Global-e and generates pre-calculated pricebooks for Fixed FX Rate markets, \n\n\nso that\n shoppers in those markets see prices in their local currency without real-time conversion at browse time.\nThe nightly pricing job runs on a scheduled basis (daily at 01:00 UTC) or can be ran manually and performs the following steps:\nRetrieve pre-calculated prices — SFCC calls the Global-e API to download the latest converted prices for all configured Dynamic and Fixed FX markets. Conversion (FX rate × coefficient × rounding) is performed on Global-e's side before the download.\nWrite to pricebooks — the downloaded prices are written to the relevant per-market pricebooks in SFCC.\nMarkets configured with a Fixed pricebook approach (manually set prices from AP21 fixed pricelists) are excluded from the FX calculation — their pricebook entries are managed via the AP21 price feed, not this job.\nFixed rate FX (we set an FX rate, these reviewed and updated with Global-e every 6 mths). Used for the our top 25 GE countries with high traffic and order volumes.\nDynamic rate FX (the FX rate is dynamic from Global-e on a daily basis). Used for the long tail countries with less traffic and order volume.",
      "status": {
        "name": "Tech design",
        "category": "To Do",
        "color": "blue-gray"
      },
      "issue_type": {
        "name": "Story"
      },
