              "type": "orderedList",
              "attrs": {
                "order": 1,
                "localId": "42acc68f1e0e"
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "29af2b683394"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given a currency is configured with the Base RRP approach, when the price is retrieved, then there is no conversion — the price is drawn directly from the storefront base pricebook."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "60a368d446e7"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "82177d83d559"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given a currency is configured with the Fixed Pricelist approach, when the price is retrieved, then the price is taken from the AP21-sourced fixed pricelist for that market (see "
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "inlineCard",
                          "attrs": {
                            "url": "https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-36",
                            "localId": "676075390dac"
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": ")."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "8ce951b32319"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "a288090e2401"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given a currency is configured with the Fixed FX Rate approach, when the price is retrieved, then the converted price calculated by Global-e is downloaded via the nightly job and stored in the SFCC pricebook for that currency."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "276c7abcfec0"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "ffa5d777fcc5"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given a currency is configured with the Dynamic FX Rate approach, when the price is retrieved, then the converted price calculated by Global-e is downloaded via the nightly job and stored in the SFCC pricebook for that currency. (see "
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "inlineCard",
                          "attrs": {
                            "url": "https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-47",
                            "localId": "a2ead678f90d"
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": " )."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "c1108ca7947b"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "544cee4887c7"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given a rounding rule is configured for a currency, when an FX conversion is applied, then the resulting price is rounded per the configured rule at line-item level before tax or promotion calculation."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "694199c44ed0"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "35d0537be69d"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given a Site Admin accesses the BM currency configuration screen, when they view the list, then they can see the conversion approach, current FX rate, last-updated timestamp, and feed status (success / stale / failed) per currency."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "35b4428f610e"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "a702657ee9ee"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given a Site Admin updates the conversion approach for a currency in BM, when the change is saved, then the new approach takes effect without a code deployment."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "39b1a66672c9"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "9aef50543fff"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given a Business Manager user has a read-only role, when they access the currency configuration screen, then they can view but not edit the conversion approach or rounding rules."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "9da467a3cd78"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "d8fcc7748d34"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given a technical user exports the currency configuration, when the export completes, then a file is produced containing all conversion approaches, per-currency settings, and rounding rules. Given a technical user imports a valid configuration file, when the import completes, then the configuration is applied in SFCC."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "88a873697512"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "customfield_10020": {
        "value": [
          {
            "id": 601,
